<title>EGYPT: RTRS-Egypt seeks 50,000 tonnes of Australian wheat.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Egypt seeks 50,000 tonnes of Australian wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official commodities buyer said on Thursday he was seeking 50,000 tonnes of standard soft white Australian wheat for delivery between December 11 and 31.</p>
<p>Samir Shakankiri, vice-chairman of the General Authority for Supply Commodities, told Reuters the deadline for offers was 0800 GMT on Friday November 15.</p>
<p>Offers are valid until Monday November 18, he added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
</text>
